    "identifier": "lightning-release-mark-of-jolts",
    "description": "<p>You conjure your lightning release chakra and mold it around a chakra seal until you form a Kanji of your own description and with its own meaning. This Kanji Floats at a point within 5 feet of you and can be moved up to 20 feet in any direction of your choice as a bonus action. Choose one of the following effects;</p>\n<p>Jolts: All creatures except you, within a 10-foot radius sphere centered on your Kanji takes 2d8 lightning damage at the end of each of your turns.</p>\n<p>Shocks: All creatures except you, within a 10-foot radius sphere centered on your Kanji that takes lightning damage must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining 1 rank of Shocked on a failed save. Once this effect has triggered and inflicted the Shocked condition 3 times this jutsu immediately ends.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6 or the number of triggers by +1.</p>",
